WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.819 --> 00:00:07.590
Part-flattened after a car loaded with explosives
passed through a military checkpoint and detonated

00:00:07.590 --> 00:00:09.890
inside the compound.

00:00:09.890 --> 00:00:15.269
Officials say several gunmen then stormed
the base -- opening fire at soldiers, before

00:00:15.269 --> 00:00:18.640
being gunned down themselves.

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:20.240
It was around six o'clock.

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:21.730
There was a very big explosion.

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:23.310
I thought there had been an earthquake.

00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:27.349
It was very strong.

00:00:27.349 --> 00:00:32.050
It's the latest in what has become near-daily
assaults by the Taliban -- who have been stepping

00:00:32.050 --> 00:00:37.149
up their attacks on government facilities
in recent months -- undeterred by the harsh

00:00:37.149 --> 00:00:38.149
winter.

00:00:38.149 --> 00:00:43.840
This time, the Taliban were able to breach
the compound's security barriers, by using

00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:47.699
a vehicle they had captured from the Afghan
military.

00:00:47.699 --> 00:00:51.640
Some of the injured were taken to local hospitals
for treatment.

00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:58.120
More serious cases were sent some 50 kilometres
away to the capital, Kabul.

00:00:58.120 --> 00:01:02.989
The government is facing accusations that
it's hiding the true death toll -- so as to

00:01:02.989 --> 00:04:52.380
avoid further worsening morale among Afghanistan's
already-shattered security forces.

